  "description": "Klatch: The Ultimate Cyclocross and Gravel Bike\nTake on any terrain with the Klatch, the perfect fusion of cyclocross and gravel bike performance. Designed for riders seeking more versatility than a road bike and more features than a traditional cross bike, the Klatch is your go-to for off-road adventures and beyond.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c Wheels: Compatible with 35mm–50mm tires for unmatched traction and comfort on gravel, dirt, and rugged trails.\n\nColumbus OMNICROM Steel Tubing: Crafted from zonally butted LIFE and MAX steel for strength, durability, and a smooth ride feel.\n\nTapered Head-Tube and Enve G Series Carbon Fork: Enhances stability and control on unpredictable terrain.\n\nFlat-Mount Disc Brakes with 12mm Thru-Axles: Provides reliable stopping power, even in wet or muddy conditions.\n\nRear Rack and Full Fender Mounts: Ideal for bikepacking, commuting, or all-weather rides.\n\nWhether you’re crushing gravel races, exploring unpaved paths, or tackling a cyclocross course, the Klatch is built to help you go farther, ride with confidence, and stay comfortable—no matter where the road (or lack of it) takes you.\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Klatch order started!",
